Bastion: the commercial gateway that puts a secure, authenticated, discoverable,
payable machine interface in front of an existing website or API.

No licence is granted. This is a statement of that rather than a change to it:
a repository with no LICENSE is already all rights reserved, and the difference
between a deliberate reservation and an oversight is not something a reader can
infer from an empty directory.

The protocols Bastion implements are separate and open: agent/1, delegation/1
and pay-policy/1 are published under their own licences in their own
repositories. This notice covers this repository only.
